TI  - Evolution of anthozoan polyp retraction mechanisms: convergent functional morphology and evolutionary allometry of the marginal musculature in order Zoanthidea (Cnidaria: Anthozoa: Hexacorallia)
AU  - Timothy D. Swain
AU  - Jennifer Schellinger
AU  - Anna M. Strimaitis
AU  - Kim E. Reuter
